<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua yeyiyandikwi na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua yeyiyandikwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakobo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Yakobo chayandikwi na mundu mweikemelewa Yakobo. Yihotoleka mwenuyu avili Yakobo mweavili mbena waki Yesu kwa nyina waki. Na chilongosi wa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vevavi va kutumbula, na avi chilongosi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va kutumbula mewa avi chilongosi wa libanji kula kuyelusalemu (Matendu 15:13). Mtumi Pauli mewa amkemili Yakobo kuvya “lipanda” La msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu, muchitabu cha (Vagalatia 2:9). Vasomi visadika kuvya chitabu cha Yakobo chayandikwi kwakona mwaka wa 50 peamali kuvelekewa Yesu Kilisitu. Muni Yakobo avili chilongosi wa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu va ku Yelusalemu yihotoleka neju kuvya ayandiki chitabu chenicho peatamayi mumuji wenuwo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yakobo akuvayandikila chitabu chenichi “Vandu va Chapanga vevadandasiki pamulima.” (1:1) Mawuliwu gegavi muchitabu cha Yakobo ndi gakuvatangatila Vandu voha vevakusadika Kilisitu, nambu ihengela malovi aga “Makabila kumi na gavili” kwa Chigiliki, ndi yilangisa kuvya avayandilikili lumonga vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu ndava muni chitabu chenichi chaganili kuvahikila vasomaji vamahele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu ichi chilongalili mambu gamahele ndalindali. Yakobo ilangisa umonga pagati ya sadika na matendu. Sadika ya chakaka ya mundu yilolekana mumatendu gaki (musula ya 2:17). Mewa ihakalila ndava ya kulangisa uganisiwu kwa vandu vevavi na vindu vya mahele (musula ya 2:1-4). Na tijiyangali na gala getijova (musula ya 3:1-12).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobo akuvajambusa vasomaji vaki (musula ya 1:1).</para>
  <para style="io">Kavili ndi akuvakangamalisa mtima kumsadika Kilisitu vandu vevavasindimala mu mang'ahiso (1:2-27).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi ijova cheyiganikiwa mundu kulangisa sadika yaki kwa matendu (musula ya 2:1-26).</para>
  <para style="io">Mewa ilangisa lulimi lwa mundu cheuvi na makakala (musula ya 3:1-12).</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobo iandaula kuvya luhala lwa Chapanga wanangana na wa pamulima (musula ya 3:13-4:10).</para>
  <para style="io">Mewawa akuvabesa vasomaji vakotoka kumeka (musula ya 4:11-5:6).</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobo imalakisila chitabu chaki kwa kujova malagizu goha, (musula ya 5:7-20).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>Nene Yakobo, mtumisi wa Chapanga na wa BAMBU Yesu Kilisitu, vikivayandikila nyenye vandu voha va Chapanga, mwemudandasiki pamulima! Nikuvajambusa!<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sadika na luhala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Valongo vangu, muvya na luheku pemwing'aiswa kwa kila njila, <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>muni mmanyili kuvya kulingiwa kwa sadika yinu yati kuvapela usindimala. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Mvya na uchakaka kuvya usindimala winu wihenga lihengu mugati yinu pamwishu, muni mkangala na kuvya ngati Chapanga cheigana muvyai, changali kupungukiwa chindu chochoha. <verse eid="JAS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Nambu ngati mmonga winu apungukiwi luhala, hinu iganikiwa amuyupa Chapanga, muni Chapanga akuvapela voha kwa umahele na kwa mtima wabwina. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Nambu iganikiwa kuyupa kwa sadika changali mtahu. Mundu mweavi na mtahu ndi ngati luyuga lwa nyanja gegikang'wa na kutagwa na chimbungululu. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Muni mundu ngati mwenuyo akotoka kuhuvalila kuvya yati ipokela chochoa kuhuma kwa BAMBU. <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>Mundu mweavi na mtahu na mweavi na maholo gavili kwa lukumbi lumonga mwangahotola kuhamula cha kuhenga pa goha geihenga.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu mngangu na mweavi na vindu vyamahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu vevavi vangangu viganikiwa kuheka pala Chapanga peakumkweha, <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>vandu vana vindu vyamahele vevakumsadika yikumgana kuheka peihuluswa na Chapanga. Muni mundu mweavi na vindu vyamahele yati iwuka na kuyaga ngati manyahi ga mdahi. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Lilanga lihumila na kuganyala mahamba, na manyahi gaki gigwa na ubwina waki woha uyaga. Mewawa yati yivya kwa mundu mweavi na vindu vyamahele yati ifwa mumahengu gaki.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulingiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Amotisiwa mundu yula mweisindimala mukulingiwa, muni akamala kusindimala mukulingiwa, yati ipewa njombi ya wumi ndi Chapanga alagini kuvapela vala veavaganili. <verse eid="JAS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Ngati mundu ilingiwa akotoka kujova, “Nilingiwa na Chapanga.” Muni mwene Chapanga nakumlinga mundu yoyoha kwa uhakau. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Nambu mundu ilingiwa peihutika na kuyonjwa na mnogo waki uhakau. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Peukiyilekela mnogu uhakau ukutalalila yiveleka kumbudila Chapanga, na kumbudila Chapanga yikakangalayi yileta lifwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Valongo vangu mkoto kukongeka! <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Kila chipanji chabwina na kila njombi yangapungula yihuma kunani kwa Dadi, Muwumba wa lumuli, ndi angang'anamuka na kawaka ulangisa wowoha wa kung'anamuka. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Kwa kugana kwaki mwene ating'anamwisi kupitila lilovi la uchakaka, muni tivya ngati mabenu ga kutumbula pagati ya viumbi vyaki.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyuwanila na kuhenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Valongo vangu vaganu mkumbuka lijambu lenili! Kila mundu ndi kuyuwanila kanyata na akotoka kuvya myeywa wa kuyangula mewa akotoka kuyoma kanyata. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Muni vandu vevana ligoga nakuhotola kuhenga gabwina palongolo ya Chapanga. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Hinu ndi mtaga kutali kuyovalela kwinu na matendu goha gahakau, mjivika pahi ya Chapanga na kupokela kwa ungolongondi lilovi lila lelipandiwi mumitima yinu, ndi lelihotola kuvasangula mwavene.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Mkoto kujikonga mwavene kwa kuyuwanila ndu lilovi laki, nambu mulihenga chelijova. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Ndava muni mundu yoyoha mweiyuwanila lilovi nambu nakulihengela lihengu mwenuyo ndi ngati mundu mweakujilola pamihu paki muchilolilo. <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>Akujilola mwene, kangi ihamba na kukosiwa cheavi. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Nambu mundu mweilola bwina malagizu yeyivi yabwina neju yeyikuvalekekesa vandu, na mundu mwenuyo akayendelela kukamula malagizu ago, ndi lepi kuyuwana ndu nambu kandahi kukosiwa, nambu akuihengela, mundu mwenuyo yati imotisiwa mukila chindu cheikita.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Ngati mundu akajiholalela kuvya akumuyogopa na kumfugamila Chapanga, na kuni akuudilalila lulimi lwaki, hinu kumuyupa kwa Chapanga kwangali mana na akujikonga wamwene. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Njila yabwina na chakaka ya kumuyupa Chapanga ndi yeniyi: Kuvatangatila vakiva na valipwela mu ng'ani kwavi, na kujiyangalila wamwene ukoto kuhakaswa na mulima uwu.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s">Lilapisu ndava ya kubagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Valongo vangu, chemukumsadika BAMBU Yesu Kilisitu, BAMBU wa ukulu, mkoto kuvabagula vandu kwa kuvalola pamihu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Tijova mundu mmonga mweawalili pete ya mashonga gamahele na nyula yabwina iyingila mngonganu winu, na bahapo iyingila mundu mngangu mwawalili nyula yeyihakili. <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>Ngati mkumtopesa mundu yula mwawalili nyula zabwina na kumjovela “Tama penapa pabwina,” Na kumjovela mngangu yula, “Veve, yima ukwo,” Amala “Tama pahi apa,” <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>Wu, wenewu lepi ubagula pagati yinu? Wu, hamula yeniyo yihumila lepi mumaholo ginu gahakau?<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Myuwanila! Valongo vangu vaganu, Chapanga avahagwili vandu vangangu pamulima apa muni ahotola kuvamotisa neju musadika na kupokela unkosi wevitalalila vala vevamganili. <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Nambu nyenye mkuvavevesa vangangu! Wu, vana vindu vyamahele ndi vevakuvahindalila na kuvatakila mu libanji la mihalu? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Wu, lepi avo vevakuliliga liina lila labwina la Yesu Kilisitu, ndi nyenye vandu vaki?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Ngati chakaka muhenga lihengu malagizu gakulu muunkosi wa Chapanga, chegayandikwi mu Mayandiku Gamsopi, “Mgana myaku ngati cheukujigana wamwene,” Yati mwikita chabwina neju. <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Nambu mkavabagula vandu, kwa kuvalola pamihu ndi mukumbudila Chapanga na yati mwihamuliwa na malagizu kuvya mbudili. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Mundu mweangayidakila mhilu umonga pagati ya malagizu goha ya Chapanga, mundu uyo yati ibuda kudenya lilagizu loha. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>Muni yulayula mweijova, “Ukoto kukita ugoni,” Ajovili mewa “Koto kukoma.” Ndava yeniyo hati ngati wangakita ugoni nambu ukomili veve wangakamula malagizu. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Hinu, mjova na kuhenga ngati vandu vevihamuliwa kwa malagizu gegilekekesa vandu. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Muni Chapanga ilangisa lepi lipyana peakumuhamula mundu angali lipyana. Nambu vandu vevavi na lipyana yati viyogopa lepi kuhamuliwa na Chapanga.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sadika na matendu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Valongo vangu, kuvi chiyonjokesu choki mundu kujova avi na sadika, nambu nakulangisa kwa kuhenga? Wu sadika yeniyo yihotola kumsangula? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Ukamlola mlongo waku mweisadika mhaja amala mlumbu avi lepi na nyula amala chakulya. <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>Ngati veve ukamjovela, “Uhamba bwina ukayota motu na kuyukuta.” Changali kuvapela chindu chochoha. Wu, chikumtangatila kyani? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Mewawa sadika yene changali matendu yifwili.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Nambu mundu ihotola kujova, “Veve uvi na sadika, nene nivi na matendu!” Hinu nilasa mundu chaihotola kuvya na sadika changali matendu, na “Nene yati nimyangula sadika yangu kwa matendu gangu.” <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Wu, veve usadika kuvya avi Chapanga mmonga? Chabwina! Nambu hati mzuka gisadika chenicho na kuvagaya kwa wogohi. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Myimu veve! Wu, wigana kulangiswa kuvya mundu mweijova nikumsadika Chapanga kuni ilangisa lepi matendu, sadika ya mundu mwenuyo yifwili? <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>Wu, Ibulahimu gogo witu ayidakiliwi wuli kuvya mbwina palongolo ya Chapanga? Ndi kwa matendu gaki, peamuwusili mwana waki Izaki avya luteta pa lusanja lwa luteta. <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Hinu, wilola, kuvya sadika yaki na matendu gaki vihengili lihengu pamonga, na sadika yaki yitimiliki kwa matendu gaki. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>Ndi gatimili Mayandiku Gamsopi chegijova, “Ibulahimu amsadiki Chapanga, na kwa sadika yaki ayidakiliwi kuvya mundu mbwina.” Palongolo yaki ndi Ibulahimu akemiwi nkozi wa Chapanga. <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Mlola hinu, kuvya mundu iyidakiliwa kuvya mbwina palongolo ya Chapanga kwa matendu gaki, na lepi kwa sadika yene ndu.<verse eid="JAS 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Mewawa yavi kwa yula mkemi mweikemiwa Lahabu, mwene ayidakiliwi kuvya mbwina palongolo ya Chapanga ndava ya kuvapokela vamang'omesi na kuvatangatila vatila kwa kupitila njila yingi.<verse eid="JAS 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Hinu ndi kujova, higa changali mpungu yifwili, mewawa sadika changali matendu yifwili.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kutalalila lulimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Valongo vangu, vamahele vinu vakotoka kuvya vawula. Ngati chammanyili, tete vawula yati tipata uhamula uvaha kuliku vangi <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Tete tavoha tibuda munjila ndalindali. Nambu ngati mundu ibuda lepi mukujova, mwenuyo ndi akangili ihotola kujilongasa mwene mumatendu gaki goha. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Tete tivika chipandi cha lyuma chidebe chechikungiwi nyosi mumlomo wa falasi, muni vatiyidikila, na kwa kuhuta tihotola kumlongosa kwokoha kwetigana. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Mewawa na watu, hati ngati uvaha neju, na ukang'wa na chimbungululu chikali nambu yihotoleka kung'anambuswa na chipandi chidebe cha ubau, na kuhamba kwokoha mgendesa watu kweigana <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Mewawa, lulimi pamonga ndi chiungu chidebe cha higa, nambu chihotola kumekela mambu gakulu neju.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Holalela motu udebe chauhotola kutinyisa dasi yivaha. <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Mewawa lulimi ngati motu umemili uhakau, wenu ndi pandu padebe muhiga nambu wileta uhakau muhiga yoha. Ulimi usopa motu wumi witu woha kuhuma kuvelekewa mbaka kufwa. Kwa motu wewihuma kuligodi litali langali mwishu. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Mundu ihotola kufuya hinyama na viumbi vyoha, hinyama ya mdahi, hidege, mayoka na viumbi vya mmanji. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Nambu kawaka mundu mweahotwili kufuya lulimi. Lulimi ndi chindu chihakau, chilongoseka lepi na chimemili chimatila yeyikoma. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>Kwa lulimi tete tikumsengusa BAMBU na Dadi witu. Kwa lulimi lulolo tikuvapela likoto vandu, vevawumbiwi kwa luhumu wa Chapanga. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Malovi ga kumotisa na ga likoto gihuma mumlomo umonga. Valongo vangu mambu ago giganikiwa lepi kuvya chenicho. <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Wu, chinyepa chimonga chihotola kuhumisa manji geginyong'onya na gegivava? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Valongo, wu, mkongo wa mtini uhotola kupambika zeituni? Amala mkongo wa zeituni uhotola kupambika tini? Mewawa chinyepa cha manji gana mwinyu nakuhotola kuhumisa manji geginyong'onya.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luhala lweluhuma kunani kwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Wu, yani mweavi na luhala na umanya pagati yinu? Hinu alangisa kwa kukita matendu gabwina muwumi waki gegikitika kwa ungolongondi na luhala. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Nambu ngati mitima yinu yimemili wihu, kuvahakalila vangi na kujigana wamwene, hinu mkoto kufiya uchakaka kwa kujilumba na kujova udese. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Luhala ngati lwenulo nakuhuma kunani kwa Chapanga, nambu pamulima na lwa chimundu na lwa Setani. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Muni popoha pepavi na wihu na kujigana mwavene, pavi na chitututu na uhakau woha. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Nambu luhala lweluhuma kunani kwa Chapanga hoti yinyambili, yigana uteke, na kuvagana vandu, yimemili lipyana na matendu gabwina, kawaka kubagula amala uhomela. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Vandu vevigana uteke vikita mambu ga kuleta uteke kwa vandu vangi, chechihumila ndi kuvya vabwina palongolo ya Chapanga.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s">Unkozi na mulima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Ngondo na kukomana kwinu kuhuma koki? Kwihuma muminogo yinu yihakau ndi zezikomana mugati ya higa zinu. <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Mnogela neju vindu na ndava muni mwipata lepi nambu mujitendekili hati kukoma. Mwilola wihu kupata vindu vyevavi navyu vangi nambu mukuvipata lepi ndi muvi na luhonda na komana. Mpata lepi chemwigana muni mukumuyupa lepi Chapanga. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Kavili, pemwiyupa mupata lepi ndava muni mwiyupa kwa maholo gahakau, mwiyupa ndava ya kuyukutisa mnogo winu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Nyenye ndi vandu mwangasadikika ngati vakemi. Mwimanya lepi kuvya nkozi wa mulima uwu ndi kuvya likoko wa Chapanga? Mundu yoyoha mweigana kuvya nkozi wa mulima ivya likoko wa Chapanga. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Mkoto kuholalela kuvya Mayandiku Gamsopi gijova malovi gawaka, pegijova, “Mpungu mweavikiwi na Chapanga avi na wihu uvaha ndava yitu ya Mpungu Msopi mweamvikii mugati yitu.” <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Nambu, ubwina wetipewa na Chapanga una makakala neju, ngati chegijova Mayandiku, “Chapanga akuvatova vevimeka nambu akuvapela vangolongondi ubwina waki.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Hinu, mujivika pahi ya Chapanga, mumbela Setani ndi yati akuvatila. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Mvya papipi na Chapanga, ni mwene yati ibwela papipi na nyenye. Msanja mawoko ginu nyenye mwemkumbudila Chapanga! Mjinyambisa mitima yinu vahomela nyenye! <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Mvya ngolongondi, mvemba na kuwombeleza, luheku lwinu luvya kuvemba, kuheka kwinu kuvya ungolongondi. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Mvya ngolongondi palongolo ya BAMBU, na mwene yati akuvakwiha.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hakalilo ndava ya kuvahamula vandu vangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Valongo, mkoto kulungamilana nyenye kwa nyenye. Mwakumjova mlongo waki na kumhamula, akuijova na kuihamula malagizu. Ngati ukuyihamula malagizu hinu veve ukuyidakila lepi nambu ukuyihamula. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Chapanga mwene ndi mwavikili malagizu na kuhamula vandu. Ndi mwene ndu mweihotola kusangula vandu na kukoma. Hinu, veve ndi yani hati uvahamula vayaku?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hakalila ndava ya kumeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>Hinu, myuwanila mwemjova, “Lelu amala chilau yati tihamba kumuji nunuyu na kutama kwenuko mwaka woha kugulisa vindu na kupata mashonga.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Nyenye mmanyili lepi gegihumila chilau muwumi winu! Nyenye ngati lyohi lelihumalila lukumbi ndu na kuyaga. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Mganikiwa kujova naha. “BAMBU akagana yati titama na kukita chenichi amala chila.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Nambu hinu mwimeka na kujilumba. Kumeka kwenuko ndi uhakau.<verse eid="JAS 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Nambu, mundu yoyoha mweamanyili lijambu labwina leiganikiwa kukitwa, nambu ikita lepi ndi akumbudila Chapanga.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s">Hakalila kwa vandu vevavi na vindu vyamahele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Hinu myuwanila nyenye muvi na vindu vyamahele! Mvemba na kuwombeleza ndava ya mang'ahiso gegakuvabwelela. <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Vindu vinu viwolili, na nyula zinu zimeminwi na makele. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Zahabu na feza yinu na zimeli chilali. Na chilali chenicho yati yivya ulangisu winu, Yene yati yilya higa yinu ngati motu. Nyenye muvili vindu mumagono ago ga mwishu. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Mlola! Mwangavalipa luhuna vanalihengu vevahengili lihengu mumigunda yinu. Myuwanila kulungamika kwavi. BAMBU Chapanga mweavi na makakala ayuwini kuvemba kwavi. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Mtamii pamulima kwa kugana kujisangalusa neju. Mjikulupalisi mwavene ngati ng'ombi cheyikulupili changali kumanya ligono la kuhinjwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Muvahamwili na kuvakoma vandu vangavabela!<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usindimala na kumuyupa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Hinu, valongo vangu, mlindila mbaka BAMBU peibwela. Mlola mlimaji cheilindila mbeyu yeamiji pandima muni abena mabenu gabwina. Mwene ilindila kwa kukangamala fula za kutumbula mbaka za mwishu. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Na nyenye mewa mganikiwa kuvya na usindimala, mkangamalisa mitima yinu, ndava ligono la kubwela kwaki BAMBU luvi papipi.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Valongo vangu, mkoto kung'ung'utilana mwavene. Mkoto kuhamuliwa na Chapanga, yula Mweihamula avi papipi kuyingila pa mlyangu. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Valongo vangu, muvakumbuka vamlota va Chapanga vevajobvili kwa liina la BAMBU, muni kuvya luhumu lwa kukangamala mukung'ahika. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>Tikuvakemela avo vana vamotisiwi muni vasindimili. Myuwini Ayubu cheasindimili, na mmanyili ndi BAMBU chamhengili mbaka pamwishu. Muni BAMBU amemili lipyana na ubwina.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Neju pa genago goha, valongo vangu, mkoto kulapa kwa kunani kwa Chapanga, amala kwa mulima, amala kwa chindu chingi chochoha. Mjova “Ena” ngati mana yinu ena, na “Lepi” ngati mana yinu ndi lepi, na penapo yati mwihamuliwa lepi na Chapanga.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Wu, kuna mundu yoyoha pagati yinu ana mang'ahiso? Iganikiwa kumuyupa Chapanga. Wu, avili mwana luheku? Iganikiwa kuyimba nyimbu za kulumba. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Wu avi mweavi na utamu pagati yinu? Iganikiwa kuvakemela vagogo va msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Chapanga, ndi yati vakumyupila na kumnyala mahuta kwa liina la BAMBU. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Vakayupa kwa sadika mtamu yati ilamiswa, BAMBU yati akumlamisa na kumbudila kwaki Chapanga yati kulekekeswa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Hinu, mjovelana nyenye kwa nyenye kubuda kwinu na myupilana muni mlamiswayi. Luyupu lwa mundu mbwina luna makakala ga kukita gamahele. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/>Eliya avi mundu ngati tete. Ayupili kwa kukangamala fula yikoto kutonya ndi yatonyili lepi pamulima miyaka yidatu na miehi sita. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>Ayupili kavili, fula yatonyili na mulima wapambiki mabenu gaki.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Valongo vangu mmonga akayaga ndava ya uchakaka, na mundu yungi akamuwuyisa, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>manya kuvya mundu mwenuyo mwakumuwuyisa kumbudila Chapanga kuhuma munjila zaki zihakau, yati akumsangula mundu mwenuyo kuhuma mulifwa, na yati akumkita Chapanga amuwusila kubuda kwaki kwamahele.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
